(7526770, 1202988, 19641, '<td valign="top">This was a tough one for me because I actually love the photo.  The issue I have is that, to me, the person in the photo is the defining element rather than the square photos in the background.  I don''t usually care for photos with a lot of noise but in this case it actually adds to the photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'This was a tough one for me because I actually love the photo.  The issue I have is that, to me, the person in the photo is the defining element rather than the square photos in the background.  I don''t usually care for photos with a lot of noise but in this case it actually adds to the photo.  Nice job!', '2017-08-02 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526772, 1203274, 19641, '<td valign="top">While I would normally think "This is just another photo of a flower", in this case it really stands out because it so perfectly addresses the requirement.  I would also be inclined to think that using grey scale with just a touch of color is a bit over done if not a cliche but again, it so perfectly supports the objective.  Very well done!  You get my highest score yet!</td>', 'While I would normally think "This is just another photo of a flower", in this case it really stands out because it so perfectly addresses the requirement.  I would also be inclined to think that using grey scale with just a touch of color is a bit over done if not a cliche but again, it so perfectly supports the objective.  Very well done!  You get my highest score yet!', '2017-08-02 22:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526773, 1202931, 19641, '<td valign="top">Don''t love the photo but you definitely nailed the requirement!</td>', 'Don''t love the photo but you definitely nailed the requirement!', '2017-08-02 22:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
