(7527529, 1203100, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>This is a lovely graphic image. The shape of the forks shadow is beautifully formed whilst also creating a sense of intrigue, it works really well. I also love the detail in the fork itself, a lovely combination of reflections and shades that again works very well, together they make for a very appealing combination. I dont feel, however, that the background does it full justice, I am imagining what this would look like against a white background and I am even more captivated by the vision I have, nevertheless the important parts are there and working really well, I like it Marcel, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. This is a lovely graphic image. The shape of the forks shadow is beautifully formed whilst also creating a sense of intrigue, it works really well. I also love the detail in the fork itself, a lovely combination of reflections and shades that again works very well, together they make for a very appealing combination. I dont feel, however, that the background does it full justice, I am imagining what this would look like against a white background and I am even more captivated by the vision I have, nevertheless the important parts are there and working really well, I like it Marcel, well done.', '2017-08-07 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
